WEBVTT

00:00.720 --> 00:03.520
♪Shrugging off past burdens♪

00:03.520 --> 00:06.110
♪Beneath the mask, who am I?♪

00:06.780 --> 00:10.180
♪Release and find wider shores♪

00:11.880 --> 00:14.890
♪Love's a riddle, and rain pours heavy♪

00:15.260 --> 00:17.790
♪Crossed paths, now downward fall♪

00:18.130 --> 00:21.570
♪From dust arises starlight's spark♪

00:23.320 --> 00:28.540
♪Tearing through
the night's dense blockade♪

00:29.220 --> 00:34.300
♪Heart's flame illuminates all solitude♪

00:35.100 --> 00:37.590
♪Let time's sails drift endlessly♪

00:37.590 --> 00:40.200
♪Through wandering exile♪

00:40.720 --> 00:47.980
♪Breaking free from the cocoon,
I start anew♪

00:48.950 --> 00:51.710
♪Moon as song, life as flame♪

00:51.770 --> 00:54.610
♪Nameless heart clings fiercely♪

00:54.900 --> 00:55.930
♪Let me♪

00:56.120 --> 01:00.200
♪Charge toward the next raging river♪

01:00.650 --> 01:03.330
♪Moon darts, snow falls♪

01:03.620 --> 01:06.320
♪We tread rugged paths to reunite♪

01:06.490 --> 01:07.960
♪Hands held tight♪

01:07.960 --> 01:12.130
♪We forever live for love's sake♪

01:12.490 --> 01:22.740
♪Shadow's spear burns fiercely♪

01:24.170 --> 01:29.720
=Legend of The Female General=

01:29.920 --> 01:32.670
=Episode 10=

01:52.539 --> 01:54.140
What a skilled martial artist.

01:55.360 --> 01:56.800
He actually killed Ding Yi,

01:58.720 --> 02:00.020
who is He Rufei's

02:00.020 --> 02:01.340
right-hand man.

02:01.980 --> 02:02.780
Young Master.

02:03.300 --> 02:04.780
What do we do about the bodies?

02:05.660 --> 02:07.180
Sun Xiangfu is a wolf in lamb's skin.

02:07.330 --> 02:08.220
His son Sun Ling

02:08.340 --> 02:09.340
is a total animal

02:09.780 --> 02:10.860
who abducts women,

02:11.420 --> 02:12.180
assaults them,

02:12.220 --> 02:13.260
and then kills them.

02:14.820 --> 02:16.420
Death is too merciful for him.

02:17.950 --> 02:19.180
We're here to get the ledgers

02:19.620 --> 02:20.980
for the Chancellor.

02:21.540 --> 02:23.300
As for those murder victims,

02:23.860 --> 02:24.660
I bet Xiao Jue

02:24.900 --> 02:26.060
will do them justice.

02:26.660 --> 02:28.100
We just need to bide our time

02:28.350 --> 02:29.380
amid the chaos.

02:35.740 --> 02:36.420
Yingxiang.

02:37.500 --> 02:38.620
After all these years,

02:38.740 --> 02:39.660
you should know

02:39.900 --> 02:40.940
that I stop at nothing

02:41.300 --> 02:42.460
to achieve my goals.

02:43.540 --> 02:44.380
Compassion

02:47.340 --> 02:48.180
is never my thing.

02:53.060 --> 02:53.780
But Young Master,

02:54.050 --> 02:54.660
you...

02:54.700 --> 02:55.500
I willingly chose

02:55.540 --> 02:56.420
this path myself.

02:57.660 --> 02:58.380
Why bother finding

02:58.380 --> 02:59.940
high-sounding excuses to justify it?

03:04.420 --> 03:04.940
Commander.

03:05.700 --> 03:07.340
I saw many posters

03:07.420 --> 03:08.580
of missing persons.

03:09.300 --> 03:10.580
They were all women.

03:11.380 --> 03:11.940
I bet

03:12.030 --> 03:13.220
it has something to do

03:13.760 --> 03:15.180
with the bodies in the courtyard.

03:15.900 --> 03:17.100
According to Ding Yi,

03:17.500 --> 03:19.380
the forbidden shrine

03:19.740 --> 03:20.900
was meant to suppress

03:21.300 --> 03:22.820
the vengeful spirits of the victims.

03:27.579 --> 03:28.820
Sun Xiangfu and Sun Ling

03:29.620 --> 03:30.740
wanted to deny them peace

03:30.740 --> 03:31.740
even in death.

03:37.090 --> 03:37.940
Commander.

03:38.660 --> 03:39.700
We must bring justice

03:39.780 --> 03:40.740
to these

03:41.100 --> 03:42.060
murder victims.

03:46.740 --> 03:47.420
For something

03:47.420 --> 03:48.460
irreversible like this,

03:49.220 --> 03:50.420
it makes little difference

03:50.700 --> 03:51.780
to handle it

03:52.660 --> 03:53.500
earlier or later.

03:54.420 --> 03:55.380
We should prioritize

03:55.380 --> 03:56.540
the provisions and funds.

03:57.340 --> 03:58.460
But there is a difference.

03:59.100 --> 03:59.980
The sooner

04:00.380 --> 04:01.580
we look into it, the sooner

04:01.860 --> 04:02.940
we bring peace

04:02.940 --> 04:03.980
to the victims

04:04.340 --> 04:05.250
and prevent others

04:05.250 --> 04:06.180
from falling victim.

04:10.820 --> 04:11.500
Commander.

04:12.060 --> 04:13.620
Should we really ignore this

04:14.140 --> 04:14.940
to secure the funds

04:14.980 --> 04:16.060
and provisions?

04:23.680 --> 04:24.620
Or do you think

04:25.820 --> 04:27.260
these victims are women

04:27.710 --> 04:29.660
that this society disregards,

04:30.020 --> 04:31.460
so they don't deserve attention?

04:33.140 --> 04:34.220
I have my plan.

04:35.100 --> 04:35.940
I don't need to

04:37.020 --> 04:38.260
explain anything to you.

05:20.990 --> 05:21.700
(These pills)

05:21.700 --> 05:22.700
(can stop bleeding.)

05:23.340 --> 05:23.980
(Take three.)

05:24.540 --> 05:25.860
(Rest in your room.)

05:28.380 --> 05:30.140
Trying to pay me off like this?

05:30.820 --> 05:31.860
Since you won't help,

05:32.130 --> 05:33.580
I'll do it my way.

05:45.710 --> 05:47.280
(Notice)

06:06.540 --> 06:07.220
He Yan?

06:08.290 --> 06:08.900
Commander.

06:09.180 --> 06:09.780
I met He Yan

06:09.780 --> 06:10.820
while investigating

06:11.180 --> 06:12.420
the missing women.

06:17.660 --> 06:18.180
It's fine.

06:18.880 --> 06:20.060
Any news from the capital?

06:20.510 --> 06:21.150
Yes.

06:21.460 --> 06:22.340
He Rufei has been

06:22.460 --> 06:24.140
eagerly currying favor with Xu Jingfu,

06:24.620 --> 06:26.060
who keeps ignoring him.

06:35.860 --> 06:37.659
It probably started a long time ago.

06:38.580 --> 06:39.420
So I was wrong

06:39.420 --> 06:40.420
about him back then.

06:41.220 --> 06:41.940
He came late

06:41.940 --> 06:43.300
to the Mingshui Battle.

06:44.860 --> 06:45.460
I bet he was

06:45.460 --> 06:46.380
already colluding

06:46.500 --> 06:47.540
with Xu Jingfu.

06:49.740 --> 06:51.180
Sending assassins after me

06:52.450 --> 06:53.620
is probably another way

06:53.659 --> 06:55.140
of pledging allegiance.

06:56.180 --> 06:57.500
We must kill him.

07:13.440 --> 07:14.740
I'm acquainted

07:16.020 --> 07:17.020
with He Rufei,

07:17.980 --> 07:18.740
but...

07:27.330 --> 07:28.580
How's it going

07:29.300 --> 07:30.140
with the plan?

07:30.660 --> 07:31.460
All set.

07:32.780 --> 07:34.020
Ding Yi vanished.

07:34.740 --> 07:35.500
Sun Xiangfu

07:36.100 --> 07:37.340
is surely restless.

07:38.060 --> 07:39.020
It's time

07:40.860 --> 07:42.380
to put on the show.

07:43.740 --> 07:44.260
Ding Yi?

07:45.220 --> 07:46.180
I haven't seen him.

07:46.860 --> 07:47.580
Why are you

07:47.780 --> 07:48.700
looking for him?

07:49.180 --> 07:50.020
I'll tell him

07:50.210 --> 07:51.100
if I see him.

07:55.360 --> 07:56.300
It's nothing

07:56.300 --> 07:57.420
particularly urgent.

07:58.700 --> 08:00.300
Thank you, Mr. Chu.

08:03.660 --> 08:04.140
See you

08:04.180 --> 08:05.180
in the dining hall.

08:07.700 --> 08:08.380
Yingxiang,

08:08.820 --> 08:09.660
keep an eye on him.

08:10.060 --> 08:11.580
He failed to kill Xiao Jue.

08:12.100 --> 08:13.060
And Ding Yi vanished.

08:13.380 --> 08:14.180
He must be

08:14.460 --> 08:15.180
restless.

08:15.780 --> 08:16.460
His life

08:16.740 --> 08:18.140
depends on those ledgers.

08:18.620 --> 08:19.860
He'll guard them carefully.

08:20.780 --> 08:21.380
Also,

08:21.820 --> 08:23.020
if you find the ledgers,

08:23.380 --> 08:24.500
lay low to avoid

08:25.140 --> 08:26.020
causing commotion.

08:26.340 --> 08:27.060
Understood.

08:40.900 --> 08:41.940
Stop eating.

08:42.740 --> 08:44.140
The guests haven't even arrived.

08:44.140 --> 08:44.980
Father.

08:45.460 --> 08:46.780
You're so rude.

08:47.620 --> 08:48.460
As the saying goes,

08:48.620 --> 08:49.580
"Appetite and lust

08:49.580 --> 08:50.460
are human nature."

08:50.900 --> 08:52.700
Are you defying the sages?

08:53.380 --> 08:53.980
You...

08:55.700 --> 08:56.300
Mr. Chu,

08:56.860 --> 08:58.060
pardon his poor manners.

09:00.500 --> 09:01.100
Commander Xiao.

09:01.460 --> 09:02.140
Mr. Cheng.

09:06.690 --> 09:07.460
Commander Xiao.

09:07.660 --> 09:08.180
Mr. Cheng.

09:08.340 --> 09:09.940
I've been waiting for you.

09:10.940 --> 09:11.700
Please be seated.

09:11.780 --> 09:12.580
Go ahead.

09:20.940 --> 09:22.300
What an extravagant feast.

09:24.030 --> 09:24.860
Uncle,

09:25.420 --> 09:27.300
you should learn from Mr. Sun

09:27.900 --> 09:28.900
and be more generous.

09:29.180 --> 09:31.100
Stop being so stingy with me

09:31.500 --> 09:32.380
or mistreating me.

09:34.060 --> 09:34.700
Mr. Cheng,

09:35.660 --> 09:37.180
have your eyes recovered?

09:37.820 --> 09:38.500
That's right.

09:38.940 --> 09:40.260
The Chief Imperial Physician

09:40.260 --> 09:41.340
is my master.

09:41.700 --> 09:42.340
I can deal with

09:42.660 --> 09:43.380
petty toxins.

09:49.980 --> 09:50.660
I recovered

09:50.900 --> 09:51.980
that very night.

09:54.180 --> 09:55.180
Then why did you

09:55.660 --> 09:56.220
waste all our

09:56.260 --> 09:56.940
precious herb...?

09:56.940 --> 09:57.500
You brat!

09:59.500 --> 10:00.180
- Come on.
- Can you...

10:00.420 --> 10:01.260
- What's wrong?
- Stop...

10:01.420 --> 10:02.220
Talking...

10:02.220 --> 10:02.740
Father.

10:02.740 --> 10:03.260
Please?

10:06.660 --> 10:07.300
Sure.

10:14.020 --> 10:14.780
Sorry, Commander.

10:15.340 --> 10:16.740
I've spoiled my son.

10:16.900 --> 10:17.980
He spouts nonsense.

10:19.620 --> 10:20.180
It's okay.

10:21.020 --> 10:21.580
In fact,

10:21.820 --> 10:23.300
I should apologize to you.

10:24.700 --> 10:25.260
My nephew

10:25.260 --> 10:26.500
has always been wayward.

10:26.900 --> 10:28.300
He's led a sheltered life,

10:28.940 --> 10:30.100
so this assassination

10:30.700 --> 10:31.660
left him traumatized.

10:32.420 --> 10:34.380
He feared further attacks

10:35.340 --> 10:37.260
and pretended to be blind.

10:37.630 --> 10:38.900
I almost got deceived, too.

10:41.420 --> 10:42.100
It's alright.

10:43.060 --> 10:43.820
In fact,

10:44.180 --> 10:45.780
it's rather interesting that Mr. Cheng

10:45.980 --> 10:47.460
pretended to be blind.

10:48.780 --> 10:49.340
Really?

10:49.340 --> 10:50.020
Totally.

10:50.060 --> 10:50.660
I think so.

10:50.660 --> 10:51.500
Exactly.

10:54.900 --> 10:56.300
The dishes are turning cold.

10:56.580 --> 10:57.340
Let's eat.

10:58.820 --> 10:59.580
I've heard

10:59.940 --> 11:01.100
about the poor harvest

11:01.100 --> 11:01.980
and that the farmers

11:02.820 --> 11:04.220
are all behind on payments.

11:05.100 --> 11:06.340
But the previous banquet

11:06.900 --> 11:08.140
and this luncheon

11:08.940 --> 11:10.420
are both exceptionally lavish.

11:11.380 --> 11:12.900
There is no sign

11:13.220 --> 11:14.260
of a famine.

11:15.380 --> 11:16.260
Or perhaps,

11:17.340 --> 11:19.660
Mr. Sun enjoys heavenly favor,

11:20.060 --> 11:21.180
where only your household

11:21.420 --> 11:22.660
receives favorable weather?

11:24.420 --> 11:25.140
I must

11:25.540 --> 11:26.860
thank Heaven.

11:32.300 --> 11:33.900
The famine does exist,

11:34.860 --> 11:35.660
but

11:35.940 --> 11:37.780
it's improved significantly.

11:38.580 --> 11:39.260
In that case,

11:39.940 --> 11:41.380
let's discuss military funds.

11:48.020 --> 11:49.500
The Yezhou merchants

11:50.100 --> 11:51.540
delay tax payments every year.

11:52.580 --> 11:54.260
That's outrageous.

11:55.180 --> 11:55.740
Well,

11:56.800 --> 11:57.500
Mr. Sun,

11:57.780 --> 11:58.940
bring out the tax ledger

11:59.100 --> 11:59.860
and show me

12:00.180 --> 12:01.020
their names.

12:08.740 --> 12:09.380
Commander,

12:09.460 --> 12:11.300
I don't think that's appropriate.

12:15.060 --> 12:16.940
You have shown such hospitality.

12:17.300 --> 12:18.020
I merely wish

12:18.500 --> 12:19.740
to return the favor.

12:19.900 --> 12:21.020
I truly appreciate it.

12:21.260 --> 12:21.780
Well,

12:22.540 --> 12:23.780
I won't make it hard for you.

12:24.420 --> 12:24.980
Mr. Sun,

12:25.340 --> 12:26.580
give me the names

12:26.860 --> 12:28.420
of the tax-evading merchants.

12:28.940 --> 12:29.580
I'll host

12:30.060 --> 12:31.260
a gathering tomorrow

12:31.620 --> 12:32.380
to give them

12:33.180 --> 12:34.300
a warning on your behalf.

12:36.740 --> 12:37.740
That's inappropriate.

12:37.780 --> 12:38.900
- Those...
- Mr. Sun.

12:39.540 --> 12:41.620
My uncle kindly offered help.

12:41.860 --> 12:42.980
Show some appreciation.

12:43.420 --> 12:44.900
Even if you can wait,

12:45.300 --> 12:46.300
the Yezhou Garrison

12:46.460 --> 12:47.500
is in dire need

12:47.540 --> 12:49.140
of provisions and funds.

12:49.620 --> 12:50.220
Mr. Cheng...

12:50.220 --> 12:50.820
Mr. Sun.

12:51.330 --> 12:52.180
Commander Xiao

12:52.320 --> 12:53.660
meant to help.

12:53.940 --> 12:55.380
Please accept his goodwill.

13:03.140 --> 13:03.820
Then

13:04.740 --> 13:06.980
thank you, Commander.

13:09.500 --> 13:10.060
Mr. Chu,

13:10.540 --> 13:11.460
would you honor us

13:11.660 --> 13:12.540
with your presence?

13:13.220 --> 13:14.180
Since you asked,

13:14.700 --> 13:16.020
how could I say no?

13:27.100 --> 13:28.060
Why did you tell them

13:28.140 --> 13:29.260
that you can see now?

13:30.660 --> 13:31.940
I was helping you.

13:35.300 --> 13:35.900
Helping me?

13:36.660 --> 13:37.300
Yeah.

13:37.780 --> 13:39.460
To intimidate the Suns

13:39.700 --> 13:40.660
so that you can

13:40.820 --> 13:41.740
carry out your plan.

13:43.820 --> 13:44.500
I know

13:44.820 --> 13:46.100
you care about

13:46.140 --> 13:47.620
those victims.

13:48.180 --> 13:48.860
Therefore,

13:48.860 --> 13:50.220
I must help you

13:50.220 --> 13:51.060
with the plan.

13:52.340 --> 13:53.460
So you're not mad at me

13:53.950 --> 13:55.360
because you know my plan?

13:59.020 --> 14:00.220
I, He Yan,

14:00.580 --> 14:01.940
thank you on behalf

14:02.620 --> 14:03.820
of those victims.

14:28.540 --> 14:30.090
(Tax Ledger)

14:33.180 --> 14:34.740
So what if you meet them?

14:35.660 --> 14:37.220
I have dirt on these merchants.

14:37.300 --> 14:39.260
They're under my control.

14:40.300 --> 14:41.860
Let's see who dares

14:43.140 --> 14:44.820
to speak against me in Yezhou.

14:51.060 --> 14:52.500
Did you see how he opened

14:53.260 --> 14:54.060
that cabinet?

14:54.980 --> 14:55.580
Yes, I did.

14:56.060 --> 14:56.780
Actually,

14:56.940 --> 14:58.380
we should thank Xiao Jue.

14:58.580 --> 15:00.020
He asked for that list

15:00.300 --> 15:01.700
and gave us a chance.

15:03.300 --> 15:03.900
Young Master.

15:04.500 --> 15:06.220
Sun Ling's bedroom is guarded.

15:06.580 --> 15:07.180
I could

15:07.260 --> 15:08.780
sneak in unnoticed,

15:09.420 --> 15:11.060
but the noise of opening the cabinet

15:11.420 --> 15:13.180
would surely alert the guards.

15:13.540 --> 15:14.180
Therefore,

15:14.500 --> 15:15.820
to retrieve the ledgers,

15:16.020 --> 15:16.820
we must draw

15:16.940 --> 15:17.980
those guards away.

15:20.140 --> 15:22.020
Xiao Jue is staging a show tomorrow.

15:22.380 --> 15:23.580
Surely, he'll be prepared.

15:24.660 --> 15:26.340
Once his men subdue the guards,

15:27.500 --> 15:28.540
that'll be your chance

15:28.620 --> 15:29.540
to get the ledgers.

15:32.620 --> 15:33.260
Young Master.

15:33.700 --> 15:34.420
This is a trap.

15:34.940 --> 15:36.500
Only Sun Xiangfu would believe

15:36.540 --> 15:37.500
that Xiao Jue genuinely

15:37.580 --> 15:38.500
wanted to help him.

15:39.300 --> 15:40.660
Why are you attending the feast?

15:41.340 --> 15:42.580
When Xiao Jue takes action,

15:42.820 --> 15:43.980
Sun Xiangfu will try

15:44.100 --> 15:45.700
to drag you down to save himself.

15:46.660 --> 15:47.460
Would it stop him

15:48.060 --> 15:49.580
from implicating me if I don't go?

15:50.980 --> 15:52.020
So I must go.

15:52.420 --> 15:52.940
I am

15:52.940 --> 15:54.260
the inspector.

15:54.740 --> 15:55.820
No matter what happens,

15:56.380 --> 15:57.460
I can intervene.

15:58.780 --> 15:59.460
However,

16:00.540 --> 16:02.340
Sun Xiangfu must be taken out

16:02.860 --> 16:04.140
to prevent complications.

16:04.940 --> 16:05.500
If he exposes

16:05.540 --> 16:06.700
his dealings with Master,

16:07.020 --> 16:07.740
then it would

16:08.420 --> 16:09.300
put me in trouble.

16:09.900 --> 16:10.660
Rest assured.

16:11.360 --> 16:12.340
I'll make sure

16:12.340 --> 16:13.660
you face no future troubles.

16:34.140 --> 16:34.940
Gentlemen,

16:35.660 --> 16:36.860
why aren't you eating?

16:38.500 --> 16:39.980
The food is nice.

16:41.900 --> 16:43.180
Why isn't anyone eating?

16:43.700 --> 16:44.260
Gentlemen.

16:44.540 --> 16:45.140
The rice

16:45.620 --> 16:46.740
comes from the hard work

16:47.100 --> 16:48.540
of the Yezhou people.

16:48.820 --> 16:49.500
These greens

16:49.860 --> 16:51.020
also come from

16:51.220 --> 16:52.540
their diligent labor.

16:52.980 --> 16:53.660
Gentlemen,

16:54.020 --> 16:55.390
why aren't you eating?

17:09.660 --> 17:10.300
Huaijin.

17:10.740 --> 17:11.540
I think

17:12.020 --> 17:14.020
these gentlemen might be

17:14.300 --> 17:15.900
overwhelmed by the tax collection

17:16.220 --> 17:17.619
and couldn't eat.

17:19.710 --> 17:21.500
Mr. Cheng is right.

17:22.900 --> 17:23.420
Dig in.

17:23.900 --> 17:24.460
Dig in.

17:35.980 --> 17:38.300
You seriously have no appetite?

17:38.980 --> 17:40.900
I know things are hard for you,

17:41.500 --> 17:42.140
but

17:43.340 --> 17:44.980
Commander Xiao doesn't.

17:45.220 --> 17:46.340
You must

17:46.370 --> 17:47.900
voice your concerns.

17:47.980 --> 17:49.580
Only then can he understand.

17:53.940 --> 17:55.140
Mr. Sun makes

17:56.180 --> 17:57.220
a fair point.

17:58.690 --> 17:59.740
Your wisdom prevails.

18:00.500 --> 18:01.100
Gentlemen,

18:01.820 --> 18:02.850
don't hold back.

18:03.540 --> 18:05.260
Tell me all about

18:06.020 --> 18:06.980
your troubles.

18:10.020 --> 18:10.580
I...

18:22.270 --> 18:23.780
Everyone's too serious.

18:24.340 --> 18:25.780
No one wishes to speak.

18:26.660 --> 18:27.460
Why don't we

18:27.660 --> 18:28.940
go for a walk?

18:29.340 --> 18:30.180
I happen to know

18:30.940 --> 18:31.580
a unique

18:31.840 --> 18:33.700
scenic spot within the Sun Mansion.

18:34.500 --> 18:35.220
Shall we

18:35.300 --> 18:36.580
invite them to join us?

18:38.020 --> 18:39.460
Great idea.

18:50.580 --> 18:51.260
Gentlemen.

18:51.820 --> 18:53.500
Commander Xiao doesn't like to wait.

18:54.820 --> 18:55.460
Shall we?

19:06.700 --> 19:07.300
Shall we?

19:08.580 --> 19:09.140
Let's go.

19:12.980 --> 19:13.540
Mr. Chu.

19:13.980 --> 19:15.820
- I...
- The great scenic spot

19:16.510 --> 19:17.340
is certainly

19:18.380 --> 19:19.420
not to be missed.

19:37.180 --> 19:38.180
My sweetie.

19:38.700 --> 19:40.140
My sweetie.

19:40.180 --> 19:41.260
My sweet girl.

19:41.260 --> 19:42.220
My child.

19:42.750 --> 19:46.060
Who did this to you?

19:52.260 --> 19:53.140
Tell me, sweetie.

19:53.140 --> 19:53.700
What...

19:55.180 --> 19:56.660
What's going on?

19:58.100 --> 19:58.900
What's going on?

19:59.740 --> 20:01.180
You should ask Mr. Sun

20:01.660 --> 20:02.740
and Young Master Sun.

20:05.250 --> 20:05.860
Well...

20:06.020 --> 20:06.580
Well...

20:06.940 --> 20:07.660
I...

20:07.820 --> 20:09.060
What's with the stuttering?

20:09.920 --> 20:11.100
Calm down.

20:11.700 --> 20:13.100
What does it have to do with us?

20:13.260 --> 20:14.260
Learn from me.

20:14.540 --> 20:15.420
Stay calm.

20:17.980 --> 20:19.060
None of our business.

20:24.320 --> 20:25.580
Sun Xiangfu.

20:27.740 --> 20:28.300
My daughter.

20:28.450 --> 20:29.100
What?

20:29.260 --> 20:30.100
Why...

20:30.500 --> 20:31.100
Why...

20:31.300 --> 20:33.180
is my daughter
found dead in your mansion?

20:33.860 --> 20:36.300
Why is my daughter
found dead in your mansion?

20:36.300 --> 20:37.660
How should I know?

20:38.500 --> 20:39.300
You should ask

20:39.340 --> 20:41.700
Commander Xiao and Mr. Cheng.

20:42.380 --> 20:43.420
Why did they bring us

20:43.420 --> 20:44.820
to this long-abandoned place?

20:44.940 --> 20:45.660
And why did they

20:45.700 --> 20:46.700
gather these corpses

20:46.820 --> 20:47.700
to show us?

20:47.820 --> 20:48.740
What do they want?

20:49.060 --> 20:49.980
What do we want?

20:51.460 --> 20:53.180
We're at your mansion.

20:53.900 --> 20:55.500
So the one who buried these remains

20:55.980 --> 20:57.340
must be from your household.

20:57.820 --> 20:58.940
Twelve bodies.

20:59.260 --> 20:59.820
That is

21:00.100 --> 21:02.060
exactly the number of missing women.

21:03.060 --> 21:04.900
Sun Ling abducted innocent women,

21:05.300 --> 21:06.140
violated them,

21:07.100 --> 21:08.860
brutally murdered them,

21:09.740 --> 21:11.140
and buried them here.

21:12.020 --> 21:12.980
And Sun Xiangfu

21:13.260 --> 21:14.380
abused his authority

21:15.100 --> 21:16.220
to cover up

21:16.980 --> 21:18.140
the heinous crimes.

21:18.980 --> 21:20.380
They should be executed.

21:22.620 --> 21:23.620
Commander, Mr. Cheng.

21:23.980 --> 21:25.300
Do you have evidence?

21:25.620 --> 21:27.020
You can't just make

21:27.180 --> 21:28.180
false accusations

21:28.420 --> 21:29.500
against us as you wish.

21:29.700 --> 21:30.260
Exactly.

21:31.820 --> 21:32.460
Mr. Chu,

21:33.620 --> 21:35.260
as a minister sent from the capital,

21:35.580 --> 21:37.060
you can tell right from wrong.

21:38.020 --> 21:39.540
Commander Xiao

21:39.580 --> 21:40.140
and Mr. Cheng

21:40.380 --> 21:41.060
are clearly

21:41.060 --> 21:42.220
holding grudges against me

21:42.340 --> 21:43.740
due to the provisions and funds.

21:43.900 --> 21:45.460
So they are

21:45.620 --> 21:47.100
blaming the murders on us.

21:47.100 --> 21:47.540
Exactly.

21:48.580 --> 21:49.300
Mr. Chu,

21:50.660 --> 21:51.340
you also think

21:52.140 --> 21:53.140
that I'm framing them?

21:55.380 --> 21:56.660
Of course, I trust you

21:56.980 --> 21:57.980
and Mr. Cheng.

21:58.500 --> 21:59.140
But

21:59.620 --> 22:00.540
these bodies alone

22:00.860 --> 22:01.820
don't prove anything.

22:02.740 --> 22:03.420
We need

22:04.180 --> 22:05.380
solid evidence.

22:05.580 --> 22:06.260
Exactly.

22:06.660 --> 22:08.380
Evidence is crucial.

22:08.580 --> 22:10.660
Mr. Chu proves to be a wise man.

22:10.820 --> 22:11.700
You heard Mr. Chu?

22:11.820 --> 22:13.340
We need solid proof.

22:13.740 --> 22:14.420
Where is

22:14.740 --> 22:15.460
the evidence...?

22:15.500 --> 22:16.380
I am the evidence.

22:22.300 --> 22:23.140
Who is she?

22:23.220 --> 22:23.740
No idea.

22:26.140 --> 22:26.940
Who is she?

22:27.620 --> 22:28.460
No idea.

22:43.140 --> 22:44.660
I am the daughter of the Chief

22:44.660 --> 22:45.540
Imperial Physician,

22:45.660 --> 22:46.460
Song Taotao.

22:47.040 --> 22:48.140
I was abducted by Sun Ling

22:48.350 --> 22:49.940
the moment I arrived in Yezhou.

22:50.180 --> 22:51.020
Everyone

22:51.340 --> 22:52.580
at the inn that day

22:52.660 --> 22:53.580
can testify to that.

22:54.140 --> 22:56.140
Had Mr. Cheng not intervened,

22:56.700 --> 22:57.500
I would be

22:57.580 --> 22:58.660
the thirteenth corpse.

23:00.480 --> 23:01.180
Father.

23:01.740 --> 23:02.420
Shut up.

23:05.950 --> 23:07.140
That's not true, Mr. Chu.

23:09.060 --> 23:10.300
Commander Xiao, Mr. Cheng.

23:10.720 --> 23:11.380
I know

23:11.420 --> 23:14.180
my son has offended Miss Song.

23:14.620 --> 23:16.180
But you can't make up something

23:16.340 --> 23:17.140
to frame my son

23:17.140 --> 23:18.300
just because of that.

23:18.420 --> 23:18.940
Yeah.

23:19.020 --> 23:20.060
You...

23:20.100 --> 23:21.220
You brat!

23:21.460 --> 23:22.500
It's all your fault.

23:22.740 --> 23:23.260
I...

23:23.420 --> 23:25.220
See? They're seeking revenge on us.

23:25.860 --> 23:27.180
They're attacking us now.

23:27.390 --> 23:28.780
They're slandering us.

23:28.780 --> 23:29.940
They're even

23:30.260 --> 23:32.620
trying to get us killed.

23:32.780 --> 23:34.620
Father, you're absolutely right.

23:34.690 --> 23:36.660
We're innocent.

23:40.900 --> 23:41.660
You're innocent?

23:43.740 --> 23:45.380
Then what's the story

23:46.940 --> 23:48.260
with these 12 deities?

23:50.580 --> 23:51.700
These 12 statues

23:52.420 --> 23:53.940
suppress 12 vengeful spirits.

23:54.700 --> 23:56.260
You committed evil deeds,

23:56.780 --> 23:57.780
and expect the deities

23:57.820 --> 23:58.700
to suppress the souls

23:58.780 --> 24:00.140
of these poor women.

24:00.940 --> 24:01.780
What a pair

24:01.780 --> 24:03.420
of "virtuous" father and son.

24:04.100 --> 24:05.140
Justice will prevail.

24:05.540 --> 24:06.220
The deities

24:06.420 --> 24:07.260
would never help

24:07.300 --> 24:08.220
villains like you.

24:08.660 --> 24:09.220
Mr. Cheng,

24:09.260 --> 24:10.540
you're crossing the line.

24:10.780 --> 24:11.380
Yeah.

24:11.500 --> 24:12.820
Who knows what's going on

24:12.860 --> 24:13.620
with the statues?

24:13.740 --> 24:15.020
It could be a coincidence.

24:15.580 --> 24:16.340
Besides,

24:16.940 --> 24:17.740
maybe...

24:18.140 --> 24:20.460
the person who planted the corpses here

24:20.740 --> 24:21.380
did this

24:21.460 --> 24:22.100
to frame us.

24:22.180 --> 24:23.060
It's very likely.

24:23.100 --> 24:23.820
Yeah.

24:24.620 --> 24:25.940
To frame you?

24:27.220 --> 24:28.380
These 12 statues

24:28.860 --> 24:29.780
vary in age.

24:30.860 --> 24:31.660
Why don't we

24:31.980 --> 24:33.740
ask the craftsmen

24:34.300 --> 24:35.220
who made them

24:35.580 --> 24:36.700
when each statue

24:37.020 --> 24:38.060
was made,

24:38.580 --> 24:39.180
and compare

24:39.180 --> 24:40.460
the dates with the time

24:40.980 --> 24:42.060
these women died?

24:42.370 --> 24:43.020
Yeah.

24:44.500 --> 24:45.940
N-No need.

24:46.260 --> 24:47.260
Father, this isn't...

24:48.060 --> 24:49.260
Sun Xiangfu.

24:49.660 --> 24:50.420
So it was

24:50.820 --> 24:52.420
you corrupt official

24:52.540 --> 24:54.820
and your son who killed my daughter.

24:55.500 --> 24:56.460
I wondered

24:56.780 --> 24:58.980
why the case dragged on.

24:59.300 --> 25:00.300
Give me back

25:00.300 --> 25:01.340
my daughter!

25:01.340 --> 25:01.950
You filth!

25:02.300 --> 25:03.420
Give her back to me!

25:04.100 --> 25:04.940
Rest assured.

25:07.260 --> 25:07.940
Commander Xiao

25:08.500 --> 25:10.220
will surely obtain justice

25:10.940 --> 25:12.660
for your daughters

25:13.300 --> 25:14.500
and all other victims.

25:16.940 --> 25:18.020
Commander Xiao,

25:18.100 --> 25:20.660
you must uphold justice for us.

25:20.860 --> 25:21.620
Everyone,

25:22.420 --> 25:23.260
please rise.

25:24.540 --> 25:26.500
I will ensure justice is served.

25:36.900 --> 25:37.460
Why is there

25:37.540 --> 25:38.980
also a male corpse?

25:41.300 --> 25:42.660
A-A male corpse?

25:49.730 --> 25:50.620
Isn't he

25:51.420 --> 25:52.700
the servant from

25:52.700 --> 25:53.780
the Sun's Mansion?

25:53.780 --> 25:54.660
No, I didn't...

25:59.700 --> 26:00.740
He's one of theirs.

26:00.780 --> 26:01.340
Yeah.

26:01.420 --> 26:02.180
I recall seeing him

26:02.780 --> 26:04.100
at Wanhua Pavilion

26:04.660 --> 26:05.980
when I first arrived in Yezhou.

26:06.240 --> 26:07.380
He was selecting dancers

26:07.460 --> 26:08.220
for the banquet

26:08.540 --> 26:09.780
following

26:10.180 --> 26:11.220
Mr. Sun's orders.

26:11.460 --> 26:12.700
He ended up selecting

26:13.180 --> 26:14.620
a bunch of assassins

26:14.740 --> 26:15.700
who tried to kill me.

26:16.540 --> 26:17.220
Could it be

26:17.780 --> 26:19.300
a part of Mr. Sun's order?

26:25.380 --> 26:27.180
What a gruesome way to die.

26:28.780 --> 26:30.100
He's just another pawn.

26:30.700 --> 26:31.660
I wonder

26:33.620 --> 26:34.900
what fate awaits

26:35.100 --> 26:35.860
Mr. Sun?

26:36.820 --> 26:38.100
He deserves to die.

26:42.100 --> 26:42.780
Well.

26:43.580 --> 26:44.500
Alright.

26:45.460 --> 26:47.300
I'll show you what fate awaits me.

26:48.780 --> 26:49.860
Just a minute.

26:54.380 --> 26:55.540
W-What is he doing?

26:55.620 --> 26:56.980
You'll find out what fate

26:57.060 --> 26:58.180
awaits me right now!

26:58.300 --> 26:59.300
Watch closely.

27:19.580 --> 27:21.750
(Account Book)

27:57.780 --> 27:58.420
Try again.

28:04.100 --> 28:05.140
They're here.

28:05.300 --> 28:06.060
What should we do?

28:06.220 --> 28:07.100
Yeah.

28:12.260 --> 28:12.780
Commander.

28:13.300 --> 28:14.780
The guards trying to barge in

28:15.380 --> 28:16.380
have been subdued.

28:16.820 --> 28:17.700
Awaiting your command.

28:18.580 --> 28:19.260
Detain them.

28:20.260 --> 28:20.780
Understood.

28:24.610 --> 28:25.860
Did you find provisions

28:27.060 --> 28:27.780
and funds?

28:27.870 --> 28:28.620
No.

28:29.020 --> 28:30.260
The warehouse is empty.

28:35.580 --> 28:36.460
Mr. Sun,

28:38.220 --> 28:39.140
since the merchants

28:39.380 --> 28:40.460
have paid their taxes,

28:41.600 --> 28:43.380
then where are the funds

28:43.980 --> 28:45.180
and provisions

28:46.050 --> 28:47.060
that you have raised?

28:47.220 --> 28:47.900
Indeed.

28:48.060 --> 28:48.620
Where?

28:48.620 --> 28:49.580
Everything's gone.

28:49.620 --> 28:51.020
The provisions and funds...

28:51.260 --> 28:51.980
Sun Xiangfu.

28:52.260 --> 28:53.060
At this point,

28:53.900 --> 28:55.380
you still won't tell the truth?

29:04.420 --> 29:05.220
Father.

29:06.660 --> 29:07.260
Father.

29:23.620 --> 29:24.620
Commander Xiao.

29:27.010 --> 29:29.140
I know what you want.

29:30.340 --> 29:31.820
Spare my son and me,

29:32.740 --> 29:34.180
and I'll tell you who...

29:35.780 --> 29:36.780
Assassins. Get them.

29:37.020 --> 29:37.860
Father!

29:38.140 --> 29:39.100
Father.

29:40.820 --> 29:41.500
Father!

29:42.620 --> 29:44.220
What should I do, Father?

29:46.460 --> 29:47.620
It's over.

29:47.820 --> 29:48.780
It's over.

29:49.460 --> 29:50.380
Father.

29:52.020 --> 29:52.940
Father.

29:54.540 --> 29:56.980
(What a great disciple of Xu Jingfu.)

30:04.620 --> 30:06.020
You've brought justice

30:06.620 --> 30:07.460
to those women.

30:08.220 --> 30:10.620
Had you not made plans to expose

30:11.140 --> 30:12.300
the Suns' crime

30:12.500 --> 30:13.700
against women,

30:14.660 --> 30:15.620
I wouldn't have been

30:16.460 --> 30:17.700
of much help.

30:19.100 --> 30:19.820
Mr. Feinu.

30:20.500 --> 30:22.100
The Commander will invite the merchants.

30:22.660 --> 30:23.300
We noticed

30:23.620 --> 30:25.180
that some of the victims

30:25.540 --> 30:27.100
had luxurious attire.

30:27.460 --> 30:29.340
They must be from wealthy families.

30:30.020 --> 30:31.020
Recently, we learned

30:31.220 --> 30:31.980
that in the city,

30:31.980 --> 30:33.820
some merchants lost their daughters.

30:33.940 --> 30:35.300
I bet there is a connection

30:36.260 --> 30:37.340
between these matters.

30:41.340 --> 30:42.900
Those women would thank you.

30:46.060 --> 30:47.660
They would thank you, too.

30:51.380 --> 30:52.580
You did well

30:52.940 --> 30:54.100
by killing Sun Xiangfu.

30:54.700 --> 30:55.620
It's my job

30:55.780 --> 30:56.900
to share your burden.

30:57.980 --> 30:59.340
(Account Book)
This is a double-edged sword.

30:59.900 --> 31:00.980
Either perish

31:01.180 --> 31:02.300
or prosper.

31:02.700 --> 31:03.300
It depends on

31:04.140 --> 31:04.780
how we wield it.

31:06.180 --> 31:06.740
Young Master.

31:07.140 --> 31:08.100
Xiao Jue's man saw me

31:08.100 --> 31:09.380
retrieving the ledger.

31:10.140 --> 31:11.220
I'm worried...

31:11.580 --> 31:12.740
Don't worry.

31:13.340 --> 31:14.460
The Chancellor is my master.

31:14.740 --> 31:16.740
Xiao Jue is definitely suspecting me.

31:17.540 --> 31:18.180
But

31:18.340 --> 31:19.100
what can he do

31:19.500 --> 31:20.420
without evidence?

31:21.780 --> 31:22.300
Commander.

31:22.560 --> 31:23.620
I followed a suspicious

31:23.620 --> 31:24.380
masked person

31:24.700 --> 31:25.340
all the way to

31:25.420 --> 31:26.220
Sun Ling's study.

31:27.140 --> 31:28.180
That person

31:28.220 --> 31:29.100
retrieved an item

31:29.420 --> 31:30.460
from a hidden compartment.

31:31.460 --> 31:32.940
I tried to recover it,

31:33.790 --> 31:34.940
but fell for a trick.

31:36.660 --> 31:37.660
Someone took advantage

31:38.500 --> 31:40.180
of the chaos to reap the benefits.

31:41.060 --> 31:42.380
So well-planned.

31:43.340 --> 31:45.060
Sun Xiangfu guarded that item

31:45.260 --> 31:46.060
so well.

31:46.700 --> 31:48.540
It must be related to Xu Jingfu.

31:49.260 --> 31:49.900
Who else

31:49.900 --> 31:50.820
besides me

31:51.380 --> 31:51.940
would care

31:51.980 --> 31:53.420
so much about Xu Jingfu?

31:55.020 --> 31:55.860
Chu Zhao?

31:57.500 --> 31:58.140
That's right.

32:01.300 --> 32:02.660
But we lack evidence.

32:05.860 --> 32:06.940
The military funds

32:06.940 --> 32:08.060
and provisions

32:09.060 --> 32:10.300
have likely ended up

32:10.380 --> 32:11.620
in Xu Jingfu's pockets.

32:12.300 --> 32:12.820
Commander.

32:13.260 --> 32:14.620
Are we really letting this go?

32:15.100 --> 32:15.980
What will the soldiers

32:16.020 --> 32:16.860
eat then?

32:19.780 --> 32:21.460
I'll settle this debt eventually.

32:23.700 --> 32:24.620
But for now,

32:25.380 --> 32:26.660
we need another solution.

32:31.340 --> 32:32.140
Have the remains

32:33.140 --> 32:34.620
been claimed by families?

32:36.580 --> 32:37.740
Three are unclaimed.

32:38.020 --> 32:38.780
They came from

32:39.300 --> 32:40.180
unknown origins.

32:40.300 --> 32:41.180
No names.

32:41.780 --> 32:42.620
No records.

32:44.580 --> 32:46.460
Then let them rest in peace.

32:50.900 --> 32:53.100
(Outside Yezhou, there's a platform)

32:53.940 --> 32:55.100
(named Chengfeng.)

32:57.140 --> 32:58.420
(Bury them there.)

32:59.300 --> 33:01.580
(Roam freely with the wind)
(May they roam freely)

33:02.820 --> 33:03.980
(with the wind.)

33:05.340 --> 33:06.420
As the saying goes,

33:07.500 --> 33:09.300
women are praised for their gentleness.

33:10.540 --> 33:11.940
But gentleness implies weakness.

33:12.820 --> 33:13.700
We can't even

33:13.740 --> 33:14.940
protect ourselves out there.

33:17.140 --> 33:18.660
This isn't about gender.

33:19.740 --> 33:20.620
Everyone

33:21.460 --> 33:22.980
grows from a fragile infant

33:22.980 --> 33:23.780
to be an adult.

33:24.700 --> 33:25.740
If you hate being weak,

33:26.300 --> 33:27.340
you can train

33:27.340 --> 33:28.220
like men do.

33:29.260 --> 33:30.020
Although

33:30.620 --> 33:31.620
it's harder

33:32.180 --> 33:33.460
for women,

33:34.380 --> 33:35.780
better to learn than not.

33:36.460 --> 33:37.020
You might

33:37.500 --> 33:38.660
even become a female general.

33:39.220 --> 33:39.940
Men

33:40.300 --> 33:41.620
should protect women

33:42.180 --> 33:43.620
and shelter them

33:44.060 --> 33:44.820
forever.

33:47.460 --> 33:48.380
I don't believe

33:49.220 --> 33:51.060
women should entrust

33:51.540 --> 33:52.980
their lives to men.

33:53.740 --> 33:54.740
Instead of being

33:55.140 --> 33:55.980
a caged bird,

33:56.580 --> 33:57.940
it's better to grow wings.

33:59.380 --> 34:00.260
That's what

34:00.700 --> 34:02.140
the Commander engraved on the steel.

34:04.460 --> 34:05.500
Roam freely

34:06.220 --> 34:07.340
with the wind.

34:22.460 --> 34:24.020
Zilan, don't cry.

34:25.820 --> 34:27.900
(Chu Mingfang, Chu Zhao's mother)
I'm just tired.

34:28.659 --> 34:29.860
If we have a next life,

34:29.940 --> 34:31.580
I'd still choose to be a woman

34:31.620 --> 34:32.739
and your mother.

34:34.690 --> 34:37.060
I'll strengthen my wings

34:37.380 --> 34:39.020
to protect you better.

34:46.780 --> 34:48.340
(If only someone had offered)

34:48.340 --> 34:49.820
(my mother justice)

34:51.900 --> 34:52.820
(back then.)

34:54.980 --> 34:56.440
(Sun Mansion)

34:57.100 --> 34:58.260
Hurry. My lord.

34:58.340 --> 34:59.140
My lord.

34:59.780 --> 35:01.340
- My lord.
- My lord.

35:01.700 --> 35:03.060
- Thank you, my lord.
- Thank you, my lord.

35:03.180 --> 35:03.980
Watch out.

35:04.180 --> 35:05.060
It's fine.

35:05.460 --> 35:07.620
They're here for you, Commander Xiao.

35:07.980 --> 35:08.580
Not really.

35:09.260 --> 35:10.540
You contributed greatly, too.

35:10.980 --> 35:12.060
Thank you, my lords,

35:12.180 --> 35:13.700
for punishing the corrupt officials.

35:13.940 --> 35:14.580
- Exactly.
- Exactly.

35:14.700 --> 35:15.220
Thank you.

35:15.340 --> 35:16.340
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

35:16.500 --> 35:17.420
Take these.

35:17.620 --> 35:18.540
We appreciate it.

35:18.660 --> 35:19.260
Huaijin.

35:19.620 --> 35:20.620
Are you overwhelmed

35:20.940 --> 35:22.220
by their enthusiasm?

35:22.940 --> 35:23.980
Do you need my help?

35:24.500 --> 35:25.540
How will you help?

35:27.220 --> 35:28.260
I'll simply

35:29.260 --> 35:30.500
cover his eyes

35:30.740 --> 35:31.740
so that he can't see.

35:33.940 --> 35:35.220
The folks mean well.

35:35.710 --> 35:37.300
Commander Xiao shouldn't storm off,

35:37.820 --> 35:38.820
right?

35:39.390 --> 35:39.980
Yeah.

35:39.980 --> 35:40.580
Yeah.

35:40.580 --> 35:41.380
- Yeah.
- Yeah.

35:41.660 --> 35:42.620
- Take them.
- Take them.

35:42.780 --> 35:43.660
- Take them.
- Take them.

35:44.100 --> 35:45.140
Yeah, Huaijin.

35:45.460 --> 35:45.980
You see?

35:46.340 --> 35:47.300
They're so enthusiastic.

35:47.700 --> 35:49.380
If you keep wearing that icy expression,

35:49.540 --> 35:50.740
it'll make you look heartless.

35:51.780 --> 35:52.340
Like this.

35:57.580 --> 35:58.500
What nonsense.

36:01.660 --> 36:02.420
Commander Xiao.

36:02.740 --> 36:03.780
I will never forget

36:03.810 --> 36:05.100
your kindness.

36:06.100 --> 36:06.980
Without you,

36:07.420 --> 36:08.620
my daughter would never...

36:10.820 --> 36:11.540
Never mind.

36:11.740 --> 36:12.580
Forget it.

36:13.300 --> 36:13.940
Commander Xiao.

36:14.260 --> 36:14.980
We know you came

36:14.980 --> 36:16.580
to secure provisions and funds

36:16.580 --> 36:17.900
for the Yezhou Garrison.

36:18.220 --> 36:19.220
So we collected

36:19.340 --> 36:20.100
money and grains

36:20.340 --> 36:22.260
from all the merchants

36:22.580 --> 36:24.780
as your provisions and funds.

36:25.220 --> 36:26.620
- Yeah.
- Yeah.

36:26.620 --> 36:27.300
Yeah, Commander.

36:27.300 --> 36:28.100
Please accept them.

36:28.180 --> 36:29.260
Take these.

36:29.380 --> 36:30.260
Take these.

36:30.780 --> 36:33.140
I'm such a lucky charm.

36:33.440 --> 36:34.940
A talent like me deserves

36:35.380 --> 36:36.980
to join the Nine Banners Battalion.

36:39.300 --> 36:40.380
Allow me to thank you

36:41.260 --> 36:43.060
on behalf of Yezhou Garrison.

36:43.980 --> 36:44.900
Our pleasure.

36:44.980 --> 36:45.580
- Our pleasure.
- Our pleasure.

36:45.620 --> 36:46.140
Take these.

36:46.140 --> 36:46.860
Let's note down

36:46.860 --> 36:47.740
your contributions.

36:48.130 --> 36:48.820
Alright.

36:48.980 --> 36:50.020
- Alright.
- Alright!

36:50.140 --> 36:51.740
- Go.
- Let's go.

36:57.580 --> 36:58.260
Commander Xiao.

36:58.420 --> 36:59.020
Mr. Cheng.

36:59.460 --> 37:00.660
I'm returning soon.

37:01.780 --> 37:02.820
I'll report this case

37:03.010 --> 37:04.220
to the court.

37:04.700 --> 37:05.460
We'll meet again

37:05.820 --> 37:06.620
if fate permits.

37:09.220 --> 37:10.420
Mr. Chu, I wish you

37:10.780 --> 37:11.580
a smooth journey.

37:11.620 --> 37:12.460
Thank you.

37:13.140 --> 37:13.780
Mr. Cheng.

37:14.300 --> 37:14.980
Actually,

37:15.220 --> 37:16.260
we've met several times.

37:16.540 --> 37:17.540
This is fate.

37:18.020 --> 37:18.740
But

37:19.260 --> 37:20.740
I still don't know your proper name.

37:21.380 --> 37:22.140
Unless you are

37:22.420 --> 37:23.860
truly Commander Xiao's nephew,

37:24.340 --> 37:25.060
Cheng Lisu?

37:27.660 --> 37:28.420
I am He Yan.

37:29.020 --> 37:29.900
"He" for seedling,

37:30.500 --> 37:31.860
and "Yan" for peace.

37:32.670 --> 37:33.540
Thank you

37:33.760 --> 37:35.540
for keeping my secret earlier, Mr. Chu.

37:35.680 --> 37:36.900
My pleasure.

37:41.780 --> 37:42.980
Mr. He, your sword dance

37:43.340 --> 37:44.260
was truly peerless.

37:45.700 --> 37:46.380
You resemble

37:47.220 --> 37:48.380
a celestial from legends.

37:53.540 --> 37:54.180
Rest assured.

37:54.740 --> 37:55.460
I will

37:56.020 --> 37:57.660
keep this a secret, too.

38:00.290 --> 38:01.540
Won't you pack?

38:02.220 --> 38:03.180
Aren't we going back?

38:03.740 --> 38:04.260
We are.

38:04.620 --> 38:05.460
Of course, we are.

38:28.670 --> 38:29.340
Huaijin.

38:29.620 --> 38:30.100
Mr. He.

38:30.540 --> 38:31.740
You finally returned.

38:32.580 --> 38:33.260
I never expected

38:33.600 --> 38:34.420
that the Suns

38:34.460 --> 38:36.220
were beasts in human disguise.

38:36.420 --> 38:37.340
But it's not bad.

38:37.540 --> 38:38.980
With such unreliable matchmakers,

38:39.300 --> 38:39.940
my parents

38:40.020 --> 38:41.140
won't force me to marry

38:41.220 --> 38:42.260
that venomous woman.

38:42.620 --> 38:43.820
Cheng Lisu!

38:45.900 --> 38:46.700
V-Venomous...

38:47.140 --> 38:47.940
Venomous woman!

38:49.020 --> 38:49.940
What did you call me?

38:50.690 --> 38:51.340
Mr. He.

38:51.340 --> 38:52.500
Catch up later.

38:52.900 --> 38:54.180
You can just tell me to leave.

38:54.260 --> 38:55.140
Why bring this

38:55.300 --> 38:55.940
venomous woman?

38:56.140 --> 38:56.820
Cheng Lisu.

38:56.820 --> 38:57.540
Prepare to die!

38:57.540 --> 38:58.340
N-No!

38:59.020 --> 38:59.660
Commander.

38:59.870 --> 39:01.260
What are they...?

39:01.700 --> 39:03.220
Cheng Lisu could be having a stroke.

39:03.740 --> 39:04.580
He needs treatment.

39:07.300 --> 39:08.660
Miss Song usually looks

39:08.700 --> 39:09.580
gentle and quiet.

39:09.620 --> 39:10.780
But she's so fierce.

39:13.100 --> 39:14.540
Only you would think that.

39:15.860 --> 39:16.660
What do you mean?

39:17.380 --> 39:19.020
I thought you were a "talent".

39:19.820 --> 39:20.620
Use your brain.

39:24.100 --> 39:25.100
For what?

39:38.340 --> 39:39.100
Poison first.

39:39.540 --> 39:40.540
Then assassination.

39:42.020 --> 39:42.740
He Rufei

39:42.740 --> 39:44.020
hasn't changed a bit.

39:46.660 --> 39:48.620
But why did he attempt to

39:48.980 --> 39:49.940
kill Xiao Jue?

39:51.980 --> 39:53.460
Do they hold

39:54.820 --> 39:55.540
any grudges

39:55.540 --> 39:56.980
that I am unaware of?

39:59.390 --> 40:01.550
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

40:01.650 --> 40:05.570
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

40:05.750 --> 40:07.690
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

40:07.790 --> 40:12.710
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

40:24.810 --> 40:26.220
♪I've seen the mountains♪

40:26.420 --> 40:27.830
♪And trodden through ice♪

40:28.100 --> 40:30.910
♪Day after day, I venture alone♪

40:31.220 --> 40:32.610
♪Destiny is my creed♪

40:32.670 --> 40:34.070
♪Ideals surge beneath the surface♪

40:34.220 --> 40:36.010
♪Igniting the flame against the winds♪

40:37.220 --> 40:38.690
♪A restless yearning in my soul♪

40:38.850 --> 40:40.140
♪Gazing through the mire♪

40:40.320 --> 40:42.710
♪Who cares about this boundless void♪

40:42.910 --> 40:44.960
♪Charge ahead with blazing fervor♪

40:46.090 --> 40:47.930
♪Stubbornly fighting with my life♪

40:49.880 --> 40:52.800
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

40:52.890 --> 40:55.550
♪There must always be a longing♪

40:56.010 --> 41:01.070
♪Disregard the wounds to seek the light♪

41:01.400 --> 41:03.410
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

